[{"text": "I now give the floor uh to her", "start": 0.56, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "excellency Cecilia Adut Majok Adeng,", "start": 3.52, "duration": 8.999}, {"text": "chair of delegation of South Sudan.", "start": 7.839, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Mr. President, Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 22.32, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "excellencies, distinguished delegates, I", "start": 25.84, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "bring you warm greetings and best wishes", "start": 29.119, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "from his excellency President Salvakir", "start": 31.359, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Mayardit, the President of the Republic", "start": 33.76, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "of South Sudan. And I bring you", "start": 36.16, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "greetings from the government and the", "start": 38.559, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "people of South Sudan together with a", "start": 40.239, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "message of peace, unity, development,", "start": 42.64, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and unwavering commitment to", "start": 45.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international cooperation.", "start": 47.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "I wish to congratulate Mr. President on", "start": 49.68, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "your election to preside over the 81st", "start": 52.64, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "session of the esteemed assembly of this", "start": 55.52, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "general assembly. I also express South", "start": 58.079, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Sudan's appreciation to the secretary", "start": 60.719, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "general. His excellency Antonio", "start": 63.039, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Gutierrez has continued his service", "start": 66.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "until the last speech he delivered here", "start": 68.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "early this week, early last week.", "start": 71.6, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "His commitment to the principle of the", "start": 74.64, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "United Nations Charter stands with us.", "start": 76.479, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Mr. President, the theme of this", "start": 79.759, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "session, restoring trust, managing", "start": 82.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "transformation, a united nation that", "start": 84.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "delivers for all, speaks directly to the", "start": 86.64, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "experience and the aspiration of the", "start": 89.36, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "people of South Sudan. As the world's", "start": 91.84, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "youngest nation and the 193rd member of", "start": 94.159, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "the United Nations, South Sudan", "start": 97.759, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "understands both the promises and the", "start": 99.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "possibilities of multilateralism.", "start": 102.479, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "South Sudan also understand that trust", "start": 105.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "is fundamental to peace. Trust among", "start": 107.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "citizens, trust between citizens and", "start": 110.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "their institutions, trust among nations,", "start": 113.6, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "and trust between member states and the", "start": 116.479, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "international institutions created to", "start": 118.479, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "serve them. South Sudan remains", "start": 120.32, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "committed to the United Nations and the", "start": 123.119, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "purpose and the principle of its", "start": 125.439, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "charter. We recognize the and we", "start": 126.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "recognize and appreciate the", "start": 130.16, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "contribution the United Nations has made", "start": 131.44, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "to South Sudan from humanitarian", "start": 133.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "assistance and protection of civilians", "start": 136.239, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "to peaceuilding development and", "start": 139.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "institutional support. However,", "start": 141.44, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "restoring trust also requires honest", "start": 144.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "reflection. Our experience has shown", "start": 147.599, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "that international institutions can", "start": 150.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "sometimes be slow to adjust to changing", "start": 153.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "circumstances on the ground. Approaches", "start": 156.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "designed to respond to conflict must be", "start": 159.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "capable of evolving as nations move", "start": 161.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "towards peace, recovery, institution", "start": 164.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "building and ownership", "start": 167.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "for South Sudan. Therefore, restoring", "start": 170.64, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "trust must mean strengthening", "start": 172.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "partnership between the United Nations", "start": 174.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and member states, respecting national", "start": 177.36, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "ownership,", "start": 180.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "recognizing progress while acknowledging", "start": 181.519, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "acknowledging remaining challenges and", "start": 184.64, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "ensuring that international engagements", "start": 187.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "ultimately strengthen the capacity of", "start": 190.879, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "the nations to assume the responsibility", "start": 193.28, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "of their own future.", "start": 196.48, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "Mr. President to understand where South", "start": 198.959, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Sudan seeks to go, one must understand", "start": 201.599, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "where South Sudan has came from. The", "start": 204.08, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "history of South Sudan did not begin", "start": 207.04, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "with the independence of the 9th of July", "start": 208.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "2011. It was shaped by more than half of", "start": 211.28, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "a century of struggle, sacrifices,", "start": 214.319, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "displacement, and unwavering desire for", "start": 217.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "freedom and self-determination.", "start": 220.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Our late Dr. John Garang de Mabure", "start": 223.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "summarized those aspirations of the", "start": 226.0, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "struggle that when he spoke freedom,", "start": 228.56, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "liberty, equality, justice, human rights", "start": 232.319, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "and democracy. Those aspiration did not", "start": 236.159, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "end with the independence.", "start": 239.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "They remain part of the ongoing work of", "start": 241.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "nation building. The comprehensive peace", "start": 245.04, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "agreement of 2005 provided the political", "start": 247.84, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "framework that transformed that", "start": 250.879, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "transformed struggles decades of", "start": 253.519, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "struggles into a peaceful exercise of", "start": 255.28, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "self-determination.", "start": 258.239, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "South Sudan therefore continues to", "start": 260.239, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "recognize that the recognize the in", "start": 262.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "indispens indispensable contribution of", "start": 265.199, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "EGD and the African and our African", "start": 267.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Union brothers and sisters as well as", "start": 270.16, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "the support of the troa the United", "start": 272.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "States the United Kingdom and Norway and", "start": 274.639, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the wider international community", "start": 277.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Sudan also remembers the extraordinary", "start": 280.479, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "contribution of the churches and", "start": 282.8, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "faith-based leaders during some of the", "start": 284.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "darkest years of the conflict. Churches", "start": 287.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "remained with the people of South Sudan.", "start": 290.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "They educated children.", "start": 292.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "They assisted displaced communities.", "start": 295.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "They mediated disputes and kept alive", "start": 297.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "the belief that reconciliation was", "start": 299.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "possible. That tradition continued with", "start": 301.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "the historical and minical pilgrimage of", "start": 305.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "peace to South Sudan by his holiness", "start": 308.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Pope Francis, the Archbishop of", "start": 310.56, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Canterbury and the moderator of the", "start": 312.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "church of Scotland. Their message", "start": 314.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "reinforced something that South Sudan", "start": 317.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "has learned through painful experience.", "start": 319.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "The message reinforced something that", "start": 322.4, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "peace requires political agreements. But", "start": 325.28, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "lasting peace also requires", "start": 328.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "reconciliation, forgiveness and courage.", "start": 330.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Mr. President, his excellency President", "start": 334.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Zvakayad belongs to the generation that", "start": 336.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "carried the struggle of liberation.", "start": 339.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Following the passing of Dr. John Garang", "start": 342.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "deabure President Kier assumed the", "start": 344.639, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "responsibility of safeguarding the", "start": 347.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "comprehensive peace agreement", "start": 349.199, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "and leading the people of South Sudan", "start": 352.4, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "towards the referendum on", "start": 354.16, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "self-determination.", "start": 356.08, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "On the on January 2011, the people of", "start": 358.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "South Sudan overwhelmingly spoke", "start": 360.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "through the ballot and on the 9th of", "start": 363.68, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "July 2011, President Kir stood before", "start": 365.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the people as the flag of the Republic", "start": 369.52, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "of South Sudan was raised for the first", "start": 371.6, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "time.", "start": 373.6, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "15 years later, South Sudan has traveled", "start": 375.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "a difficult road. There has been", "start": 378.319, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "achievements. There also have been", "start": 381.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "setbacks. South Sudan experienced", "start": 383.6, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "internal conflict shortly after", "start": 386.24, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "independence. Implementation of the of", "start": 388.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "the militarized peace agreement has", "start": 390.639, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "taken longer than originally intended or", "start": 392.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "anticipated. Economic and humanitarian", "start": 395.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "challenges remain significant.", "start": 397.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "The government does not deny these", "start": 401.199, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "realities, but neither should these", "start": 403.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "challenges be allowed to erase the", "start": 406.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "progress made or define permanently the", "start": 408.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "identity of the Republic of South Sudan.", "start": 412.16, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Throughout the transition period,", "start": 415.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "President Kir has repeatedly made one", "start": 417.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "commitment clear.", "start": 419.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "He will not take South Sudan back to", "start": 422.24, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "war.", "start": 424.08, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "This commitment has guided his approach", "start": 425.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to peace process and remain fundamental", "start": 428.479, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "to his vision for the next chapter of", "start": 431.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "South Sudan. The mission before", "start": 433.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "President Kir is therefore different", "start": 436.08, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "from the mission of the liberation", "start": 438.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "years. The liberation struggle sought to", "start": 440.639, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "give the people of South Sudan the right", "start": 444.16, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "to determine their destiny. The", "start": 445.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "responsibility today is to consolidate", "start": 448.319, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "peace, strengthen institution, and", "start": 450.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "create conditions through which the", "start": 453.199, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "people of South Sudan can once again", "start": 455.759, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "determine their political future through", "start": 457.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "democratic means. Mr. President, when", "start": 460.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "the people of South Sudan voted for", "start": 463.599, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "their independence, they voted they were", "start": 465.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "voting for more than creation of a new", "start": 467.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "state. They were voting for a dream.", "start": 470.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "They dreamt of a peace after generations", "start": 473.28, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "of war. They dreamt of schools for their", "start": 476.4, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "children, health care for their", "start": 479.039, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "families, roads connecting their", "start": 481.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "communities, food security and economic", "start": 483.199, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "opportunities, justice and equality,", "start": 486.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "strong institutions and a government", "start": 488.879, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "whose authority ultimately drives from", "start": 491.759, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "the will of its people.", "start": 494.16, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "The difficulties of the last 15 years", "start": 496.879, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "have been not extinguish not to", "start": 499.599, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "extinguish those dreams. they remain", "start": 502.319, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "alive among the people of South Sudan.", "start": 504.8, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "And it's it's precisely for this reason", "start": 507.599, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "that His Excellency President Zalva", "start": 509.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "remains committed to paving the way", "start": 512.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "towards general election scheduled for", "start": 514.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "December 2026.", "start": 517.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "These elections are intended to mark the", "start": 519.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "conclusion of the transition period and", "start": 522.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "provide the people of South Sudan the", "start": 524.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "opportunity to choose democratically", "start": 526.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "their own leaders.", "start": 529.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "We recognize the important work ahead.", "start": 531.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Electoral institutions require adequate", "start": 534.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "resources. Political dialogue must", "start": 537.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "continue. Security arrangements must", "start": 539.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "advance. Civic and voter education must", "start": 541.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "reach communities. Women and young", "start": 543.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "people must participate meaningfully.", "start": 546.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Refugees and internally displaced person", "start": 549.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "must not be left out. And an environment", "start": 552.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "must be created to which political", "start": 555.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "competition can occur peacefully. The", "start": 557.68, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "government remains committed to working", "start": 560.48, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "towards these objectives.", "start": 562.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "For far too long, South Sudan has often", "start": 564.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "been seen internationally through the", "start": 567.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "lens of conflict, humanitarian needs,", "start": 569.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and political crisis. President Kir's", "start": 573.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "vision is to create the condition in", "start": 576.24, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "which the world can once again see the", "start": 578.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "people of South Sudan for who they truly", "start": 580.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "are. A resilient people who struggled", "start": 582.399, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "for freedom, voted peacefully for", "start": 586.0, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "independence, continue to aspire for", "start": 588.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "peace, dignity, democracy and", "start": 590.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "prosperity. The people of South Sudan", "start": 594.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "must increasingly speak for themselves", "start": 597.519, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and they must speak through the ballot.", "start": 600.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Our journey therefore continues from", "start": 602.959, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "liberation struggle to comprehensive", "start": 605.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "peace agreement to the referendum to", "start": 607.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "independence from conflict to peace and", "start": 610.24, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "now from transition towards democratic", "start": 612.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "governance. Mr. President, the message", "start": 616.079, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "of President K remains clear. South", "start": 619.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Sudan must not return to war. Political", "start": 622.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "disagreement must not be addressed.", "start": 625.2, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "Political disagreement must be addressed", "start": 627.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "through dialogue. Political competition", "start": 629.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "must never again become armed", "start": 632.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "confrontation.", "start": 635.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "The ballot must replace the bullets.", "start": 636.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "South Sudan recognizes that conducting", "start": 639.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "peaceful elections requires security and", "start": 642.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "strong institutions. The government", "start": 646.079, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "bears the primary responsibility for", "start": 648.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "protecting its citizens. Maintaining", "start": 650.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "public order and safeguarding the", "start": 653.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "electoral process. South Sudan therefore", "start": 654.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "continues to call for constructive", "start": 658.0, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "engagements with the security council", "start": 659.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "concerning restrictive measures", "start": 662.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "including the arms embargo. South Sudan", "start": 664.88, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "objective is not militarization.", "start": 667.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The objective is to develop professional", "start": 670.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "unified disciplined and accountable", "start": 673.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "security forces operating under the", "start": 675.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "civilian authority and the rule of law.", "start": 678.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "South Sudan believes that that", "start": 681.44, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "accountability and national capacity", "start": 683.839, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "should reinforce themselves.", "start": 685.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "We therefore call for the lifting of all", "start": 688.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "restrictive measures. Sanctions and a", "start": 690.64, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "sanction must be instruments for", "start": 694.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "achieving", "start": 696.079, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "clear defined objectives. They should", "start": 698.48, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "not become permanent substitute for", "start": 700.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "political engagements and institution", "start": 703.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "buildings. Mr. President South Sudan", "start": 705.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "remains grateful for the contribution of", "start": 709.12, "duration": 3.279}, {"text": "the United Nation mission in South", "start": 710.88, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "Sudan. We recognize the men and women", "start": 712.399, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "who serve the United Nations flag who", "start": 714.959, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "served under the United Nations flag", "start": 717.279, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "particularly those who have lost their", "start": 719.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "lives in the service of peace.", "start": 721.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "As South Sudan advance its transition", "start": 723.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "international international engagement", "start": 726.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "al must also evolve. President Kir's", "start": 728.959, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "vision is not for South Sudan to remain", "start": 732.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "indef indefinitely dependent upon", "start": 734.639, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "international peacekeeping. The", "start": 737.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "objective must be a South Sudan capable", "start": 739.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "of sustaining its own peacekeeping.", "start": 741.76, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "South Sudan therefore calls for a", "start": 745.92, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "greater emphasis on peace building,", "start": 747.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "institutional development, continu", "start": 749.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "continuous capacity building and we are", "start": 752.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "also keen to establishing partnership.", "start": 754.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Invest in South Sudan police and", "start": 758.079, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "judiciary. Invest in public", "start": 760.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "administration. Invest in education and", "start": 763.2, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "healthcare. Invest in infrastructure.", "start": 765.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Invest in women and young people. invest", "start": 768.639, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "in institutions that will sustain peace", "start": 771.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "long after peacekeepers have departed.", "start": 773.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "The ultimate measures of a successful", "start": 776.48, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "peacekeeping should be the establishment", "start": 778.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "of condition under which peacekeeping is", "start": 780.959, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "no longer required. South Sudan", "start": 783.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "therefore seeks the response seek a", "start": 786.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "responsible transition man from managing", "start": 788.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "crisis towards building a lasting", "start": 791.2, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "national capacity. Mr. President, peace", "start": 793.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "cannot be sustained without development.", "start": 796.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "And at independence, South Sudan", "start": 799.76, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "inherited extremely limited", "start": 801.68, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "infrastructure and institutional", "start": 803.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "capacity. Nation building, state", "start": 806.079, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "building and service delivery have", "start": 808.88, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "therefore have to proceed", "start": 811.04, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "simultaneously.", "start": 812.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "President Kier has placed particular", "start": 814.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "emphasis on agriculture, infrastructure,", "start": 817.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "education, healthcare, and economic", "start": 820.079, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "diversification.", "start": 822.56, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "South Sudan possesses million of", "start": 824.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "hectares of urbal land, significant", "start": 826.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "water resources, livestocks, fishery,", "start": 829.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "natural resources, and one of the", "start": 832.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "youngest population in the world. South", "start": 834.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Sudan therefore seeks to transition", "start": 836.56, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "progressively from humanitarian", "start": 839.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "dependency to self reliance and towards", "start": 841.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "a sustainable development and", "start": 844.639, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "investment.", "start": 846.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "For a farmer, a road to a market is", "start": 848.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "development. For a child, a functioning", "start": 852.0, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "school is development. For a mother,", "start": 855.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "access to health care is development.", "start": 858.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "For a young person, employment is", "start": 861.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "development. And for South Sudan,", "start": 863.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "development is one of the strongest", "start": 866.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "foundation for lasting peace.", "start": 868.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "We therefore invite international", "start": 871.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "partners and responsible investors to", "start": 872.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "look beyond South Sudan's current", "start": 875.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "challenges and recognize its potential.", "start": 877.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Do not ask only what South Sudan needs.", "start": 880.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Ask what South Sudan can offer.", "start": 883.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Mr. President, South Sudan continues to", "start": 886.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "face severe consequences from climate", "start": 889.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "shocks despite contributing minimally to", "start": 891.839, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "global emission. Recurring floods,", "start": 894.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "droughts, displacement, and food", "start": 897.76, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "insecurity are affecting millions of", "start": 899.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "South Sudin. South Sudan", "start": 901.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "therefore reiterates its call for", "start": 905.199, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "predictable and accessible climate", "start": 907.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "financing, investment and adaptation,", "start": 909.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "resilient infrastructure, renewable", "start": 912.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "energy, agriculture and technology", "start": 914.399, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "transfer. Climate justice must reflect", "start": 917.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "not only in commitments but in the", "start": 921.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "implementation.", "start": 923.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Mr. President South Sudan and young", "start": 925.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "people, women and young people of South", "start": 927.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Sudan are central to President K's", "start": 930.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "vision. The Roth peace agreement", "start": 933.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "provided 35% representation for women in", "start": 935.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "public institutions. South Sudan", "start": 938.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "continues on working to translate those", "start": 940.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "commitment into meaningful participation", "start": 943.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "at all levels. South Sudan also is an", "start": 945.839, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "overwhelmingly young population. These", "start": 949.199, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "young people should not inherit a", "start": 951.759, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "conflict of previous generation. They", "start": 954.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "should inherit opportunities of peace.", "start": 957.92, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Education, vocational training,", "start": 961.519, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "technology, entrepreneurship,", "start": 963.759, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "agriculture, and sports. That is the", "start": 965.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "future they deserve. Mr. President,", "start": 968.32, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "decades of conflict scattered South", "start": 971.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Sudin across the world. But South Sudin", "start": 973.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "diaspora should not be viewed only", "start": 977.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "through the history of displacement.", "start": 979.199, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "It is also an extraordinary national", "start": 982.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "resources. Our national basketball team,", "start": 984.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "the bright star, demonstrated this", "start": 987.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "before the world. Saludanese whose", "start": 989.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "journey had taken them across different", "start": 992.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "countries and and continents came", "start": 995.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "together under one flag.", "start": 997.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Under the leadership of Lur Deng and the", "start": 1000.399, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "South Sudan Basketball Federation, South", "start": 1002.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Sudan qualified for the basketball world", "start": 1005.199, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "cup and subsequently the Olympic Games.", "start": 1007.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "They showed the world the image of South", "start": 1011.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Sudan not conflict, not displacement but", "start": 1014.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "talent,", "start": 1017.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "discipline, unity and excellence. The", "start": 1019.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "experience the experience offers this", "start": 1023.04, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "experience offer a model for national", "start": 1025.76, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "development.", "start": 1028.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "South Sudan doctors abroad can", "start": 1030.24, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "contribute to healthcare. Engineers can", "start": 1032.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "contribute to infrastructure. Academians", "start": 1035.679, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "can strengthen education. Entrepreneurs", "start": 1038.079, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "can invest and create employment.", "start": 1040.64, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Technology professionals can conduct can", "start": 1043.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "connect South Sudan to digital economy.", "start": 1045.919, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "And successful South Sudinis around the", "start": 1048.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "world can mentor the next generation.", "start": 1050.799, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "to the international community. We need", "start": 1054.72, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "to create a stronger partnership that", "start": 1056.96, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "would enable South Sudan diaspora to", "start": 1059.039, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "transfer their skills and professional", "start": 1061.679, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "experience in order to contribute to the", "start": 1064.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "ongoing development in the Republic of", "start": 1066.48, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "South Sudan.", "start": 1068.32, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "To the South Sudanese diaspora, our", "start": 1070.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "message is simple. South Sudan needs", "start": 1072.799, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "you. Bring your knowledge home. Bring", "start": 1075.36, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "your experience home. Bring your", "start": 1078.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "investment home. And bring your networks", "start": 1080.799, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "home.", "start": 1083.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Where physical return is not possible,", "start": 1084.799, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "allow your skills and experience to", "start": 1087.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "contribute to South Sudan.", "start": 1089.52, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The same spirits, the same spirits that", "start": 1092.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "brought South Sudanese athletes from", "start": 1094.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "around the world together under one flag", "start": 1096.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "can help bring South Sudin expertise", "start": 1098.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "together for one national purpose. South", "start": 1101.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Sudan greatest resources is ultimately", "start": 1104.24, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "its people both at home and abroad. Mr.", "start": 1106.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "President South Sudan stand in", "start": 1110.64, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "solidarity with the people of Sudan.", "start": 1112.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "South Sudan and Sudan share his history,", "start": 1115.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "families, econ economic interests and", "start": 1118.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "one of the longest border in the region.", "start": 1121.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "South Sudan therefore reiterates it", "start": 1124.48, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "ongoing and continued full support for a", "start": 1126.16, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "lasting peace in the Sudan. South Sudan", "start": 1129.679, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "knows from the experience that military", "start": 1133.039, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "confrontation ultimately requires a", "start": 1135.6, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "political solution. Even the longest", "start": 1138.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "conflict must eventually reach a", "start": 1140.559, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "negotiated settlement. South Sudan", "start": 1142.48, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "therefore supports regional and", "start": 1145.36, "duration": 3.439}, {"text": "international efforts aim at achieving", "start": 1146.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "peace in Sudan. Outstanding matters", "start": 1148.799, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "arising from the comprehensive peace", "start": 1152.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "agreement including the border issues", "start": 1153.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and the final status of ABA also", "start": 1156.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "requires a peaceful engagement between", "start": 1158.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "South Sudan and Sudan.", "start": 1161.52, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Mr. President, restoring trust also", "start": 1164.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "requires reform of institutions of", "start": 1166.799, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "global governance. The composition of", "start": 1169.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the security council does not equitably", "start": 1172.64, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "reflect the realities of today. Africa", "start": 1174.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "with 54 member states remains without a", "start": 1177.919, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "permanent representation on the council.", "start": 1180.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "South Sudan therefore reinforms its", "start": 1183.679, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "support for the common African position.", "start": 1185.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Africa must be appropriately represented", "start": 1188.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "in both permanent and non-permanent", "start": 1191.28, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "categories. Similarly, developing", "start": 1193.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "countries must have a stronger voice in", "start": 1196.24, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "international financial institutions and", "start": 1198.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "decisions concerning development,", "start": 1201.039, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "financing, debt, climate, and", "start": 1202.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "technology. Reforms do not weaken", "start": 1205.28, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 1207.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Reforms strengthen its legitimacy. Mr.", "start": 1209.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "President 15 years after the", "start": 1213.039, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "independence, South Sudan remains a", "start": 1215.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "young nation undertaking the difficult", "start": 1218.32, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "work of building a state while", "start": 1220.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "consolidating peace and delivering", "start": 1222.96, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "development. The journey has not been", "start": 1225.2, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "easy, but the liberation the liberation", "start": 1227.679, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "the liberation generation fought for", "start": 1231.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "freedom. The generation of the", "start": 1233.039, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "comprehensive peace agreement secured", "start": 1235.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the pathway to self-determination. The", "start": 1237.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "people of South Sudan chose independence", "start": 1239.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "through the ballots and his excellency", "start": 1242.48, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "president Salvakir Mayard carried the", "start": 1245.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "responsibility of leading South Sudan", "start": 1247.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "through referendum and into statehood.", "start": 1249.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Today, President Kir's vision is", "start": 1252.4, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "directed towards another historical", "start": 1254.4, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "responsibility", "start": 1256.48, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "to preserve peace, strengthen national", "start": 1258.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "institutions, pave the way towards", "start": 1260.96, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "elections through which the people of", "start": 1263.2, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "South Sudan can determine the next", "start": 1265.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "chapter of their nation. This ultimately", "start": 1267.679, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "this ultimately about completing the", "start": 1271.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "promise of independence.", "start": 1274.48, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "A South Sudan at peace with itself. A", "start": 1277.039, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "South Sudan governs through strong", "start": 1279.679, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "institution. A South Sudan where", "start": 1282.559, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "political competition does not lead to", "start": 1284.559, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "war. A South Sudan where women", "start": 1287.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "participate fully. And where young", "start": 1289.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "people have opportunities,", "start": 1291.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "where refugees can return home, where", "start": 1294.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the diaspora can contribute to national", "start": 1297.039, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "development, and where children grow up", "start": 1299.44, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "knowing South Sudan, not through the", "start": 1302.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "marmoirs of peace, of war, but through", "start": 1304.159, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "the possibilities of peace.", "start": 1306.96, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Dr. John Garang once challenged the", "start": 1309.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "people of South Sudan to unite and dream", "start": 1311.679, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "together.", "start": 1314.48, "duration": 3.199}, {"text": "That dream did not end with", "start": 1316.159, "duration": 3.041}, {"text": "independence.", "start": 1317.679, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "It continues today. And today the", "start": 1319.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "responsibility of President K is and his", "start": 1322.32, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "government is the political leadership", "start": 1325.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "is indeed is that people of South Sudan", "start": 1328.159, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "must dream and must have a functioning", "start": 1331.039, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "peaceful and a prosperous South Sudan.", "start": 1334.08, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "to our international partners who stood", "start": 1337.36, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "with us during our liberation struggle", "start": 1339.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "and during the comprehensive peace", "start": 1343.919, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "agreement and during the referendum and", "start": 1345.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "at independence.", "start": 1347.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "We say stand with South Sudan again. But", "start": 1349.76, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "let this chapter be a partnership that", "start": 1353.2, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "strengthen national ownership, a", "start": 1356.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "partnership that build institutions, a", "start": 1358.96, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "partnership that recognizes progress", "start": 1361.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "while helping address remaining", "start": 1363.36, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "challenges. A partnership that enables", "start": 1365.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "South Sudan progressively to stand on", "start": 1367.84, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "its own. Mr. President, for South Sudan,", "start": 1370.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "restoring trust means delivering on the", "start": 1373.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "promises of peace. Managing", "start": 1377.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 1379.76, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "means moving from conflict to", "start": 1381.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "institutions, from dependency to", "start": 1383.28, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "national capacity, and from transition", "start": 1385.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "towards democratic governance.", "start": 1388.32, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "and a United Nations that deliver for", "start": 1391.44, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "all means ultimately help nations", "start": 1393.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "develop the capacity to deliver for", "start": 1396.799, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "their own people. South Sudan remains", "start": 1399.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "committed to the United Nations. South", "start": 1402.48, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Sudan remain committed to Africa and", "start": 1404.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "South Sudan remain committed to peace", "start": 1407.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "and under the leadership of his", "start": 1410.48, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "excellency President Salvak Mayard,", "start": 1412.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "South Sudan remains committed to the", "start": 1414.32, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "long journey of transforming the", "start": 1416.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "sacrifices of liberation into peace,", "start": 1418.559, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "dignity, development, democratic future", "start": 1421.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "for which the people of South Sudan have", "start": 1425.039, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "waited for generations.", "start": 1427.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "That is the promise of independence.", "start": 1430.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "That is the responsibility of this", "start": 1432.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "generation and that is the future South", "start": 1434.32, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Sudan seek to build. May the all lord", "start": 1436.72, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Almighty bless the people of South Sudan", "start": 1439.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and may the Lord Almighty bless all the", "start": 1442.559, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "nation represented in this assembly. I", "start": 1444.96, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "thank you for your kind attention.", "start": 1447.52, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "I thank the chair of delegation of South", "start": 1454.72, "duration": 5.959}, {"text": "Sudan.", "start": 1457.679, "duration": 3.0}]